# cards: Termite's guard makes an enemy's break miss (docs/plan-cards.md 11.13). One Abadon (row 36) forced
# into a regular battle as enemy_force.plan (no strength cheat: its AGI 255 makes every enemy attack miss), its action
# chances set so it always picks action 1, its break. Jian's own guard bit (0x800, party slot 0) is pinned in the battle flags, as a Termite use on him sets it.
# Jian's equipment slots 0 to 4 (0x020B4698 to 0x020B46A0) are watched: a break swaps a piece for its broken version. Expect no slot to change. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
# Delrich Temple (map 6), standing off the enemy spawn points (as boss_gronk.plan)
pin u16 0x020B77EC 6
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
# Jian's battle HP (stat record 0 + 0x14) stays 999
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x14 999
# Row 36 (0x02097CE4 + 36 * 0x54 = 0x020988B4): HP 30000 at level 0 and 98, AI class 3, action 1 (the break) always
watch u16 0x020B4698 slot0
watch u16 0x020B469A slot1
watch u16 0x020B469C slot2
watch u16 0x020B469E slot3
watch u16 0x020B46A0 slot4
poke u16 0x020988B8 30000
poke u16 0x020988CC 30000
poke u32 0x020988B4 0x3
poke u16 0x020988E0 0xFFFF
poke u16 0x020988E2 100
poke u16 0x020988E4 100
poke u16 0x020988E6 100
# Formation: at func_0202bc28's entry (right after func_0202b948 filled ctx 0x020B85B8), lead row +0x32 and
# the eight slots +0x34..+0x42 (slot i = battler 4 + i) are overwritten: only slot 5 (front, a ground
# species' lead slot) holds row 36
execpoke 0x0202BC28 u16 0x020B85EA 36
execpoke 0x0202BC28 u16 0x020B85EC 0xFFFF
execpoke 0x0202BC28 u16 0x020B85EE 0xFFFF
execpoke 0x0202BC28 u16 0x020B85F0 0xFFFF
execpoke 0x0202BC28 u16 0x020B85F2 0xFFFF
execpoke 0x0202BC28 u16 0x020B85F4 0xFFFF
execpoke 0x0202BC28 u16 0x020B85F6 36
execpoke 0x0202BC28 u16 0x020B85F8 0xFFFF
execpoke 0x0202BC28 u16 0x020B85FA 0xFFFF
# Start a regular (non-event) battle, formation 0, through the field's own battle state
poke u16 0x020B7838 0
poke u16 0x020B783A 0
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
pinptr u32 0x020B8550 0 2048
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
shot ice_cmd
# Auto battle: Right, A, A (confirm)
press Right 3
wait 10
press A 3
wait 20
press A 3
peek u32 0x020B8550 work
watch u32 0x02282940 flags
wait 60
shot st_00
wait 60
shot st_01
wait 60
shot st_02
wait 60
shot st_03
wait 60
shot st_04
wait 60
shot st_05
wait 60
shot st_06
wait 60
shot st_07
wait 60
shot st_08
wait 60
shot st_09
wait 60
shot st_10
wait 60
shot st_11
peek u32 0x020B8550 work_end
